we journey through this life♪

339
00:19:11,520 --> 00:19:13,060
♪Troubled times
are but a laughing matter♪

340
00:19:13,060 --> 00:19:14,310
♪However, the world changes♪

341
00:19:14,310 --> 00:19:16,230
♪You'll still be by my side♪

342
00:19:16,230 --> 00:19:17,920
♪Side by side,
we journey through this life♪

343
00:19:17,920 --> 00:19:19,490
♪Praise and blame come and go♪

344
00:19:19,490 --> 00:19:21,060
